# Toss Phase Isolation Rule

When `phase === "toss"` the server MUST:

- Route all `submit_team_answer` events to `[server/socket.ts](mdc:server/socket.ts)` -> `handleTossSubmission`.
- Prevent any normal question pipeline code from executing.
- Never emit `team_answer_finalized` or `team_battle_question_results`.
- Store toss answers in a temporary per-team map `tossMemberAnswers`.
- Only call `finalizeTossWinner` when a correct submission is received.

This rule helps maintain a clear separation between toss and normal game logic.

